# Terraform — never commit local cache, state, plans, or secrets
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfplan
**/tfplan
**/tfdestroyplan
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
*_override.tf
*.auto.tfvars
**/terraform.tfvars
**/private_key.pem
**/plan.txt
**/destroy-plan.txt
**/kubectl.sha256
*.bkp
